From: Sergey Matyukevich <geomatsi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 May 2016 22:41:32 +0300
Subject: [Buildroot] [PATCH 1/1] board: add support for LinkSprite pcDuino
Message-ID: <1464291692-28094-1-git-send-email-geomatsi@gmail.com>
List-Id: <buildroot.busybox.net>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
To: buildroot@busybox.net

Add basic support for LinkSprite pcDuino v1 board series
including pcDuino, pcDuino-Lite, pcDuino-Lite-WiFi.

Tested on pcDuino-Lite-WiFi.

Signed-off-by: Sergey Matyukevich <geomatsi@gmail.com>
